  "body": "I think the HTML standard should stop making reference to ECMAScript as 'JavaScript'. JavaScript is the technologies historic name and should only be referred as such for backwards compatibility reasons, such as with MIME types.\r\n\r\nUsing two names for the same product just make it confusing.",
